|{ cwd, include, args, ... }|
# The build of nodeflight: the firmware for each target, to out/<target>/.
# `all`, the default, builds the targets stm32f722xe and stm32f746xg; each
# target is also a target of ninja of its own name. No arguments: the
# toolchain is arm-none-eabi-gcc from PATH.
#
# See builddef/ for how it is put together.
(include "${cwd}/builddef/build.pbb" { repo = cwd; }).main args